ty-vision">Equity Vision</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/equity-vision/equity-advisory-committee">Equity Advisory Committee</a></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/equity-vision/anti-racist-schools">Anti-Racist Schools</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel4"><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/equity-vision/anti-racist-schools/escuela-y-comunidad-antiracista">Escuela y Comunidad Antiracista</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/equity-vision/anti-racist-schools/anti-racist-schools">反種族主義學校和社區轉變之旅 (Anti-Racist Schools)</a></li></ul></div></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/equity-vision/student-equity-councils">Student Equity Councils</a></li></ul></div></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/forms">Forms</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/healthy-kids-survey">Healthy Kids Survey</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/interpreter-service">Interpreter Service</a></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/covid-19-information">Infectious Illness Information</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/covid-19-information/protocolos-de-seguridad-de-covid">Información sobre enfermedades infecciosas</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/measure-l-2020-bond">Measure L - 2020 Bond</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/measure-l-2020-bond/mitigation-of-negative-declarations">Mitigation of Negative Declarations</a></li><li><a href="/departments/capital-facilities/capital-facilities/bonds-citizens-oversight-committee">Citizens Oversight Committee</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/press-releases">Media Room</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/press-releases/enews-archives">Enews Archives</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/mobile-device-policy">Mobile Device Policy</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="/our-district/board-of-trustees/board-policies/cell-phone-policy-information/mobile-device-consequences">Mobile Device Consequences</a></li></ul></div></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/report-safety-concerns">Report a Safety Concern</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/request-for-qualificationsrequest-for-proposals">Request for Qualifications/Request for Proposals (RFQ/RFP)</a></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/required-notifications">Required Notifications</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/required-notifications/file-a-complaint">File a Complaint</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel4"><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/required-notifications/file-a-complaint/title-ix">Title IX</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/required-notifications/file-a-complaint/williams-uniform-complaint-procedures">Williams Uniform Complaint Procedures</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/required-notifications/file-a-complaint/uniform-complaint-procedures">Uniform Complaint Procedures</a></li></ul></div></li><li><a href="https://simbli.eboardsolutions.com/Search/ShowSearchResults.aspx?S=36030427" target="_blank">Maintaining Appropriate Adult-Student Interactions<span class="fsStyleSROnly" data-nosnippet="">(opens in new window/tab)</span></a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/required-notifications/sexual-harassment-policies">Sexual Harassment Policies</a></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/school-and-community-safety">School and Community Safety</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/school-and-community-safety/school-safety-plans">School Safety Plans</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/school-and-community-safety/reporting-a-safety-issue">Reporting a Safety Issue</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/school-and-community-safety/the-big-five">The Big Five</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/school-and-community-safety/instructional-continuity-plan-icp">Instructional Continuity Plan (ICP)</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/school-and-community-safety/e-bike-safety">E-Bike Safety</a></li></ul></div></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/school-locator-and-boundaries">School Locator and Boundaries</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/school-year-calendar">School Year Calendar</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/stay-connected">Stay Connected</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/required-notifications/file-a-complaint/title-ix" target="_blank">Title IX Information<span class="fsStyleSROnly" data-nosnippet="">(opens in new window/tab)</span></a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/required-notifications/file-a-complaint/uniform-complaint-procedures" target="_blank">Uniform Complaint Procedures-14488<span class="fsStyleSROnly" data-nosnippet="">(opens in new window/tab)</span></a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/logo-redesign-community-input">Logo Redesign</a></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/sustainability-fa">Sustainability</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="https://public.tableau.com/app/profile/san.mateo.union.high.school.district/viz/SMUHSDSustainabilityDashboard/SMUHSDSustainabilityDashboard" target="_blank">Sustainability Dashboard<span class="fsStyleSROnly" data-nosnippet="">(opens in new window/tab)</span></a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/sustainability-fa/sustainability-facilitators">Sustainability Facilitators</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/sustainability-fa/sustainability-week">Sustainability Week</a></li></ul></div></li><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/contact-us">Contact Us</a></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/general-information/parents-rights-and-responsibilities">Parents Rights and Responsibilities</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="/our-district/general-information/parents-rights-and-responsibilities/firearm-safety">Firearm Safety</a></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/district-news/district-updates">District News</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel2"><li><a href="/our-district/district-news/district-updates">District Updates</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/district-news/actualizaciones">Actualizaciones</a></li><li class="fsNavParentPage"><a href="/our-district/district-news/awards">Robert Griffin Leadership Awards</a><div class="fsNavPageInfo"><ul class="fsNavLevel3"><li><a href="/our-district/district-news/awards/spring-2026-recipient-jeff-gilbert">Spring 2026 Recipient: Jeff Gilbert</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/district-news/awards/new-page">Fall 2025 Recipient: Dr. Samia Shoman</a></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li><li><a href="/students/resources/file-a-complaint">File a Complaint</a></li><li><a href="/our-district/resources-opportunities">Resources and Opportunities</a></li></ul></nav>
	</div>


